# Chorochromatic Map

## Overview

This repository contains an academic Chorochromatic Map created using **ArcMap 10.7.1** as part of my B.Sc. Geoinformatics coursework. The project demonstrates the use of qualitative thematic mapping to represent different categories of geographical features.

## Objective

To represent different categories or types of geographic features using distinct colours, allowing easy identification and comparison of spatial patterns.

